<title>UK: TABLE-RANK H1 PROFITS FALL SHORT OF VIEWS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-RANK H1 PROFITS FALL SHORT OF VIEWS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30</p>
<p>		     (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.9		    vs 7.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.25		   vs 5.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     87		     vs 99</p>
<p> Turnover		   856		    vs 940</p>
<p>NOTE - Above earnings results exclude exceptional items. Including exceptionals, pretax profit was 85 million stg versus 144 million stg.</p>
<p>Turnover from continuing operations was 853 million stg versus 817 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 90 and 98 million stg.</p>
<p>Rank said exchange rate movements cut current H1 pretax profit by 2.0 million stg and would continue to hurt earnings for the full year at current average rates.</p>
<p>Full company name - Rank Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
